{"ref":"BDB, תְּשׁוּבָה","hw":"תְּשׁוּבָה","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">תְּשׁוּבָה</span>]</big>  <strong>n.f. return, answer</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וּתְשֻׁבָתוֹ הָרָמָ֫תָה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 7:17\" href=\"/I_Samuel.7.17\">1 S 7:17</a> <em>and his return was</em> (= he returned) <em>to Rama</em>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  especially cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">לִתְשׁוּבַת הַשָּׁנָה</span> <em>at the return of the year</em>, i.e. of spring, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 11:1\" href=\"/II_Samuel.11.1\">2 S 11:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 20:22\" href=\"/I_Kings.20.22\">1 K 20:22</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 20:26\" href=\"/I_Kings.20.26\">26</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 36:10\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.36.10\">2 Ch 36:10</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לְעֵת תְּשׁ׳ הַשּׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 20:1\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.20.1\">1 Ch 20:1</a> (‖ <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 11:1\" href=\"/II_Samuel.11.1\">2 S 11:1</a>).<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>answer</em>, pl. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּשֻׁבֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 34:36\" href=\"/Job.34.36\">Jb 34:36</a>, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּשׁוּבֹתֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 21:34\" href=\"/Job.21.34\">21:34</a>.","next":"BDB, שׁוּבָאֵל","prev":"BDB, מְשׁוֹבָב²"}